    "descriptionZh": "Tailwind CSS 的实验性即时（JIT）编译器：按模板里实际写到的类名现算样式，而不是构建时一次性全量生成；该项目已并入 Tailwind CSS 2.1 主仓库，此仓库只读。",
    "takeawayZh": "看 Tailwind JIT 最早的实现，仓库 2021 年已归档",
    "noteZh": "进页面先是一条黄底横幅——This repository was archived by the owner on Apr 6, 2021. It is now read-only.，标题旁也挂着 Public archive 徽标，About 栏是 No description, website, or topics provided.。README 开头直接说明 As of Tailwind CSS v2.1 this project has been merged with the core Tailwind CSS repository，接着按 Overview、Getting started、Documentation、Known limitations、Roadmap、License 排，Overview 里举了 800ms 编译、3ms 增量重建和任意值方括号写法 top-[-113px]。文件树很浅，只有 .github、src、tests 三个目录加 postcss.config.js，Used by 8.1K。",
